<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings rise 200 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings rise 200 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude oil loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal rose sharply by 200 percent to 875,273 tonnes in the week to July 8 from 291,880 tonnes in the previous week, Shetland Island Council said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Liftings continued to be destined within Europe, with only one tanker heading trans-atlantic.</p>
